    "created_at": "2021-02-10T16:34:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-02-10T16:34:27Z",
    "body": "It's not about agents as such, it's about how another spec should hook into \"a method on the console object is called\" and get the method name and the arguments (post-formatting).",
